{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4e6b9705-1289-8785-970a-bf61764eae02",
  "created_at": "2025-12-29T14:08:33-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ellen Lawton",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:06:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:06:03-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. My name is Ellen Lawton. I'm calling because my recycling bin went missing after the pickup today. Basically I put it out at the curb last night, and when I got home from work at lunch it was just gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:06:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, gone as in the truck took it, or it's not out there at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:06:24-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not out there at all. The trash can is still sitting there, empty, but the blue bin is nowhere. I checked down the street a little in case it blew over, and nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:06:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:06:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "31 Brewer Street, in the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:06:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thirty-one Brewer. Got it. Is this the first time it's happened?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:06:46-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it's the second miss in a row, basically. Two weeks ago the bin disappeared too and I assumed a neighbor grabbed it by mistake. I got a replacement from somebody, and now that one's gone as well."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:07:00-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm, okay. So two bins in two pickups. That's worth noting. I'll put in a request for a replacement bin, and I'll flag it so the crew supervisor sees it's a repeat at your house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:07:13-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Do I need to do anything on my end?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:07:18-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just let me confirm a few things. Is it the standard blue recycling bin, the big one with the lid?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:07:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the standard one with the lid, the rolling kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:07:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And a good callback number in case the driver or the supervisor wants to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:07:37-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0161."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:07:39-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-one. Perfect. Delivery usually takes a few days, give it till the end of the week or so. If it hasn't shown up by Friday, call us back and mention today's request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:07:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sounds good. And in the meantime, should I just hold my recycling until it comes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:07:58-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, hold onto it. Or if you've got a spare sturdy container, you can put the recyclables out in that, just mark it clearly as recycling so they don't skip it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:08:09-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, I'll do that. Oh, random, but I drove over the Newport Bridge on the way home last night and it looks lovely lit up at night. Anyway, sorry, that's off topic."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:08:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it really is pretty this time of year. Alright, Ellen, you're all set. The request is in for 31 Brewer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:08:29-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, thanks, Denise. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T14:08:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
